{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this wild and colorful graphic adventure, you play as <strong>Tofu</strong>, a cheeky little college hamster with zero shame and a whole lot of attitude. Dive into an out-of-control college night in the city of <strong>Furrol</strong>, where the party never sleeps, secrets hide behind every sip of juice, and every animal has their own drama to spill. A story packed with partying and mystery, tons of humor and terrible jokes, but above all\u2026 <strong>Drug\u2014wait, I mean, SUGAR!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Load up on gummies\ud83c\udf6c, juice boxes\ud83e\uddc3, and chocolate bars\ud83c\udf6b</strong> to experience the true <strong>Furrol Experience</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a night of partying with your campus\u2019s most chaotic ferret, <strong>Churro</strong>, quickly spirals into a surreal mystery when something weird happens after the first round of juice. <br><strong>Your mission:</strong> figure out what went down and survive the weirdest night of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a ride through neon lights, chaotic beats, unforgettable characters, and sooo many sweets. \ud83c\udf6d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Dive into the wild side of Furrol </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the chaos, the madness, and the humor of a city that blends the best (and worst) of college life. From graffiti-covered buildings to streets where rules are just a suggestion, <strong>Furrol</strong> is a love letter to reckless youth and an unhealthy obsession with candy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a living, detailed city filled with unique areas:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme bars, underwater nightclubs, secret alleys, and not-so-legal candy shops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every venue has its own vibe, music, and wild local fauna.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new zones</strong> as you progress through the story (or do the right \u201cfavors\u201d).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/66d5eb86870c9943525861d93edfaafb.poster.avif?t=1768514629\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/66d5eb86870c9943525861d93edfaafb.webm?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/66d5eb86870c9943525861d93edfaafb.mp4?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  \ud83d\udc3e\u00a0<strong>Chat with all kinds of animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>The soul of the game lies in its characters. Meet and talk to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bats who are existentialist poets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frogs that live for influencer life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moles obsessed with conspiracy theories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawler penguins and DJ bunnies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every conversation could lead to a quest, a clue... or just an absurdly unforgettable moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/9eed29dd61b37f623eb08893b4122fdd.poster.avif?t=1768514629\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/9eed29dd61b37f623eb08893b4122fdd.webm?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/9eed29dd61b37f623eb08893b4122fdd.mp4?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d\u00a0<strong>Complete quests to uncover the night\u2019s mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is clear (well, kind of): <strong>figure out the chaos</strong>. But to do that, you\u2019ll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape Tofu\u2019s personality \u2014 are you full chill or full chaos? You decide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore each venue with its own unique vibe and look for clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate some very questionable witnesses and fulfill their weird requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And, of course, go totally wild and consume <strong>LOTS OF SUGAR</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/d6bbbba2cd6279b33f9a7198cef333fb.poster.avif?t=1768514629\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/d6bbbba2cd6279b33f9a7198cef333fb.webm?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/d6bbbba2cd6279b33f9a7198cef333fb.mp4?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81\u00a0<strong>Find all the collectibles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig deep to unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited-edition, one-of-a-kind candies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories, hidden references, and memes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret achievements that reward your curiosity and love for the absurd.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/69e52dfd2aae2d6c5460eb02d7ed0aab.poster.avif?t=1768514629\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/69e52dfd2aae2d6c5460eb02d7ed0aab.webm?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/69e52dfd2aae2d6c5460eb02d7ed0aab.mp4?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae\u00a0<strong>Conquer first 2 minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A college night without doing something stupid? Not on our watch!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 games to test your reflexes and rhythm, show off your dance floor skills, or flex your musical talent...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some minigames will change Tofu\u2019s status (yep, tipsy mode included!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/01c92463f4123f7bdde5d0097fc9f845.poster.avif?t=1768514629\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/01c92463f4123f7bdde5d0097fc9f845.webm?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538130/extras/01c92463f4123f7bdde5d0097fc9f845.mp4?t=1768514629\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet me in Furrol?</strong> <br>11 PM at the plaza \u2014 <strong>don\u2019t be late!</strong> \ud83c\udf6d\u2728</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Once you pop...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/895b69b8440ddc5164b4fdc4701e6906905a082e.jpg"},{"name":"Be a loser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/ac48f6a5e3293e9f40a464e0c148c390c020f205.jpg"},{"name":"First class cheeser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/c877fa0e1c525337e5827aa6e703ddc4108d6788.jpg"},{"name":"Labyrinth specialist, oops i'm dizzy...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/f4243a3cafe61a83c486c25a89bc79ebabbf738a.jpg"},{"name":"Cuak cuak... POOF! Time Event","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/3780f21f1dc801552b58b3c8c2b6068ab294dd57.jpg"},{"name":"Master, legend, icon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/bebb1ceaf5b77d9469c522eb934dac5bf87c13e7.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta go fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/58f6f3b09a089e0e44495734a26876acb5146e91.jpg"},{"name":"God of bonk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/72d41b86683b752cb275df4c1964fabb6f5904ed.jpg"},{"name":"Fruitlic coma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/38b1a12401b4f4f19cafd9fe3940ef888ae494fa.jpg"},{"name":"Allergic to chocolate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3538130/8a8bd12a0534c929b968df9e6cfc62b7ff92aed0.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538130?t=1768514629","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3538130?t=1768514629","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538